Suggests: clangd
Description: small terminal text editor with nano keys
 Cedit is a terminal text editor written in C. It uses nano keys by
 default and offers Emacs and Ctrl+S/Ctrl+Q key layouts. It handles
 large files, saves atomically, highlights twelve languages and talks
 to language servers for diagnostics and completion.
